ux-bench corpus: third-party notices

The pages in this folder were captured from openly licensed sources for
measuring ux-skill's linter. Each page's source, licence and attribution are
in bench/manifest.json. Every script element, inline and external, was
removed from the stored pages, so no stored page loads or runs code; inline
event-handler attributes and javascript: links remain only as markup.
Images and web fonts were not stored. Logos and crests a licence excludes
were removed. The pages generated for the bench
(a-gen-*) are part of this repository and under its MIT License.

